@title The Issues list opens beside a left-hand window, not over its edge
@area Windows
# A window hanging from the left (Bench output) steps right of the flyout while it is open; its text is not cut.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text Reports
wait 5
click_text "Bench output..."
wait 20
click_text "warning"
wait 10
shot issues-beside-bench
check_layout
# At 1920x1080 the Issues list is pinned beside the canvas; the dialog opens beside it, not over it. The distances are
# asserted by the unit tests in panel.rs; the picture shows them.
